{"id":"forecast-10","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-10/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":1024.19,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":8.04,"text":"Part 4. You will hear a talk at a university open day to students interested in following","words":[["Part",0.0,0.54],["4.",0.54,1.0],["You",1.84,2.54],["will",2.54,2.7],["hear",2.7,2.96],["a",2.96,3.2],["talk",3.2,3.48],["at",3.48,3.82],["a",3.82,3.94],["university",3.94,4.42],["open",4.42,4.86],["day",4.86,5.2],["to",5.2,5.96],["students",5.96,6.38],["interested",6.38,7.26],["in",7.26,7.62],["following",7.62,8.04]]},{"start":8.04,"end":15.16,"text":"a course in textiles and business studies. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["a",8.04,8.36],["course",8.36,8.58],["in",8.58,8.84],["textiles",8.84,9.66],["and",9.66,10.0],["business",10.0,10.3],["studies.",10.3,10.78],["First,",11.98,12.68],["you",13.42,13.6],["have",13.6,13.76],["some",13.76,13.96],["time",13.96,14.32],["to",14.32,14.54],["look",14.54,14.66],["at",14.66,14.86],["questions",14.86,15.16]]},{"start":15.16,"end":72.42,"text":"31 to 40. Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["31",15.16,16.14],["to",16.14,16.76],["40.",16.76,17.2],["Now",67.8,67.96],["listen",67.96,68.28],["carefully",68.28,68.78],["and",68.78,69.66],["answer",69.66,70.0],["questions",70.0,70.42],["31",70.42,71.42],["to",71.42,72.06],["40.",72.06,72.42]]},{"start":75.69,"end":81.59,"text":"Thank you first of all for coming along to the university's open day and in particular","words":[["Thank",75.69,76.23],["you",76.23,76.49],["first",76.49,76.83],["of",76.83,77.11],["all",77.11,77.29],["for",77.29,77.51],["coming",77.51,77.77],["along",77.77,78.05],["to",78.05,78.27],["the",78.27,78.39],["university's",78.39,79.21],["open",79.21,79.45],["day",79.45,79.83],["and",79.83,80.85],["in",80.85,81.07],["particular",81.07,81.59]]},{"start":81.59,"end":86.75,"text":"for coming to this talk to find out about our course in Textiles with Business Studies.","words":[["for",81.59,81.95],["coming",81.95,82.19],["to",82.19,82.45],["this",82.45,82.63],["talk",82.63,83.01],["to",83.01,83.29],["find",83.29,83.53],["out",83.53,83.81],["about",83.81,84.11],["our",84.11,84.45],["course",84.45,84.85],["in",84.85,85.27],["Textiles",85.27,85.87],["with",85.87,86.11],["Business",86.11,86.39],["Studies.",86.39,86.75]]},{"start":87.81,"end":93.61,"text":"The cooperation between the Faculty of Arts and Architecture and the Business Faculty enables","words":[["The",87.81,88.37],["cooperation",88.37,88.87],["between",88.87,89.57],["the",89.57,89.77],["Faculty",89.77,90.01],["of",90.01,90.31],["Arts",90.31,90.57],["and",90.57,90.75],["Architecture",90.75,91.21],["and",91.21,91.65],["the",91.65,91.77],["Business",91.77,92.07],["Faculty",92.07,92.73],["enables",92.73,93.61]]},{"start":93.61,"end":97.39,"text":"us to offer this undergraduate and integrated Masters course.","words":[["us",93.61,94.03],["to",94.03,94.25],["offer",94.25,94.47],["this",94.47,94.85],["undergraduate",94.85,95.53],["and",95.53,95.85],["integrated",95.85,96.19],["Masters",96.19,96.87],["course.",96.87,97.39]]},{"start":98.21,"end":103.01,"text":"In the five years this course has been running, we've learned a lot and it's become very","words":[["In",98.21,98.47],["the",98.47,98.59],["five",98.59,98.81],["years",98.81,99.09],["this",99.09,99.33],["course",99.33,99.61],["has",99.61,99.79],["been",99.79,99.97],["running,",99.97,100.29],["we've",100.83,101.13],["learned",101.13,101.35],["a",101.35,101.49],["lot",101.49,101.75],["and",101.75,102.23],["it's",102.23,102.45],["become",102.45,102.73],["very",102.73,103.01]]},{"start":103.01,"end":103.43,"text":"popular.","words":[["popular.",103.01,103.43]]},{"start":104.35,"end":109.47,"text":"Now, thanks to the Faculty of Engineering, we're also able to offer a really exciting","words":[["Now,",104.35,104.81],["thanks",104.93,105.21],["to",105.21,105.43],["the",105.43,105.57],["Faculty",105.57,105.83],["of",105.83,