,["to",210.36,210.64],["computer",210.64,211.32],["-aided",211.32,211.92],["design.",211.92,212.48]]},{"start":213.68,"end":218.92,"text":"Students at this point, year two, decide if they intend to complete the course at","words":[["Students",213.68,214.32],["at",214.32,214.68],["this",214.68,214.88],["point,",214.88,215.22],["year",215.5,215.68],["two,",215.68,216.0],["decide",216.6,217.16],["if",217.16,217.4],["they",217.4,217.56],["intend",217.56,217.78],["to",217.78,218.02],["complete",218.02,218.32],["the",218.32,218.5],["course",218.5,218.74],["at",218.74,218.92]]},{"start":218.92,"end":224.9,"text":"Year 3 with a BA ONS or Progress to Year 4 and conclude with a Masters in Design.","words":[["Year",218.92,219.14],["3",219.14,219.46],["with",219.46,219.74],["a",219.74,219.88],["BA",219.88,220.16],["ONS",220.16,220.92],["or",220.92,221.28],["Progress",221.28,221.84],["to",221.84,222.2],["Year",222.2,222.34],["4",222.34,222.7],["and",222.7,223.1],["conclude",223.1,223.52],["with",223.52,223.72],["a",223.72,223.88],["Masters",223.88,224.22],["in",224.22,224.5],["Design.",224.5,224.9]]},{"start":226.0,"end":231.42,"text":"Students can also have tutorials if they feel they need help making this important decision.","words":[["Students",226.0,226.32],["can",226.32,226.66],["also",226.66,226.94],["have",226.94,227.16],["tutorials",227.16,227.76],["if",227.76,228.64],["they",228.64,228.84],["feel",228.84,229.14],["they",229.14,229.34],["need",229.34,229.62],["help",229.62,229.9],["making",229.9,230.28],["this",230.28,230.5],["important",230.5,230.96],["decision.",230.96,231.42]]},{"start":232.38,"end":236.06,"text":"This reflects our commitment to student support at all times.","words":[["This",232.38,232.6],["reflects",232.6,233.04],["our",233.04,233.34],["commitment",233.34,233.74],["to",233.74,234.08],["student",234.08,234.46],["support",234.46,235.02],["at",235.02,235.26],["all",235.26,235.44],["times.",235.44,236.06]]},{"start":241.54,"end":246.3,"text":"Year 3 co