],["collection.",268.0,268.6]]},{"start":269.56,"end":275.0,"text":"Also, to help underpin the commercial aspect of the course, we ask for a business plan.","words":[["Also,",269.56,270.18],["to",270.36,270.5],["help",270.5,270.72],["underpin",270.72,271.32],["the",271.32,271.48],["commercial",271.48,271.92],["aspect",271.92,272.4],["of",272.4,272.64],["the",272.64,272.74],["course,",272.74,273.08],["we",273.22,273.44],["ask",273.44,273.82],["for",273.82,274.12],["a",274.12,274.28],["business",274.28,274.5],["plan.",274.5,275.0]]},{"start":275.0,"end":281.76,"text":"On the subject of career opportunities, many graduates work directly within the textile","words":[["On",275.0,276.26],["the",276.26,276.42],["subject",276.42,276.74],["of",276.74,277.04],["career",277.04,277.5],["opportunities,",277.5,278.32],["many",279.02,279.36],["graduates",279.36,279.94],["work",279.94,280.22],["directly",280.22,280.8],["within",280.8,281.12],["the",281.12,281.44],["textile",281.44,281.76]]},{"start":281.76,"end":288.66,"text":"business, with careers commonly found as stylists and retail managers. However, it shouldn't","words":[["business,",281.76,282.34],["with",282.78,282.98],["careers",282.98,283.42],["commonly",283.42,283.98],["found",283.98,284.34],["as",284.34,284.6],["stylists",284.6,285.34],["and",285.34,285.68],["retail",285.68,286.24],["managers.",286.24,286.68],["However,",287.62,288.0],["it",288.22,288.36],["shouldn't",288.36,288.66]]},{"start":288.66,"end":294.38,"text":"be forgotten that there are many other exciting opportunities out there, for example, careers","words":[["be",288.66,288.84],["forgotten",288.84,289.26],["that",289.26,289.5],["there",289.5,289.64],["are",289.64,289.74],["many",289.74,290.06],["other",290.06,290.6],["exciting",290.6,291.3],["opportunities",291.3,291.94],["out",291.94,292.28],["there,",292.28,292.5],["for",292.58,292.68],["example,",292.68,293.18],["careers",293.74,294.38]]},{"start":294.38,"end":300.34,"text":"in journalism, for those 